# API base URL
# Dev mock (default): /api  → Vite mock at /api/chat
# Real backend: use the host root only — backend serves POST /chat (no /api prefix)
#   e.g. http://127.0.0.1:8000  or  https://your-backend.fly.dev
# GitHub Pages: set repository variable VITE_API_BASE_URL to your public backend URL
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
